[11:35:09.169] ======================================================================
[11:35:09.169] free() does not necessarily unmap the VMA; the address stays
[11:35:09.169] valid while the object lifetime has already ended.
[11:35:09.169] A plain run often prints 100 and does NOT crash - that is why
[11:35:09.169] ASan is required to detect this class of bug deterministically.
